        description
            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.6.2 (open).
            Proof IDs: PROOF-016, AMEND-P05, API-P03, and PROOF-001 through PROOF-015.
            Historical source clause: AMEND-API-001 is migrated as quickstart readiness
            evidence only.
            Deliverable: Packed consumer proving applications that exercise accepted APIs through
            production owners, including one Incident Console browser journey.
            Keep consumer proofs on public package routes; do not import private implementation.
            Allowed writes: packages/flow-state-rewrite/test/packed/** and
            reference/incident-console/implementation/test/everclear-new-intent/**.
            Keep the Todo, offline-notes, bounded-feed, React, and isolated-package fixtures
            under the packed-consumer test owner.
            Evidence: AMEND-API-001 quickstart compilation and execution reach successful
            temporary readiness through a fresh packed package, proved by AMEND-P05. The
            production actor-turn proof is separate API-P03 evidence; application and browser
            receipts name affected Plans.
            Phase 5 validation T506 must pass before this work starts.
        acceptance
            Todo Essentials, Incident Console, and Hydrated Offline Notes compile and run
            against only accepted package routes.
            Todo covers compound states, refs, operations, React, fixtures, Stories,
            checkpoints, and TestClock. Incident Console covers conflicts, streams,
            inspection, diagnostics, CLI/artifacts, and browser lifetime.
            Offline Notes proves request isolation, context-closed persistence, first
            render, outbox/reconnect/disposal, exact hydration, and host seeding.
            Bounded-feed authored dropping/coalescing streams, React 18 and 19, and
            isolated TypeScript consumers pass. Reject Flow pressure options and
            inferred app requirements. React and type proofs cannot be showcase-only.
            The quickstart's executed path reaches successful temporary readiness through the
            packed package. Keep its actor command/snapshot continuation commented; the old
            AMEND-API-004 citation is provenance only. It does not count as the separate API-P03
            production actor-turn proof.
            API-P03 separately proves one production actor turn through the packed package.
            Incident Console browser behavior passes on accepted public routes.
            No proof uses private imports, deleted APIs, or fabricated testing paths.
            Run `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite build` and
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:packed-consumers`.
            Application-owned browser checks also pass; record their exact commands.
