        description
            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.6.3 (open).
            Proof IDs: CUT-P01 through CUT-P04, PROOF-017.
            Deliverable: Row-by-row runtime, declaration, deep-import, authoring, and
            side-effect-free rejection evidence for every deleted or replaced surface.
            Prove retained boundaries separately through their production owners.
            Allowed writes: feature-local tests, packages/flow-state-rewrite/test/packed/**,
            and source owners only to correct a demonstrated boundary gap.
            Evidence: Runtime export and type negatives, behavior rejection results, and retained
            owner proofs, mapped to the Cutover disposition ledger.
            Phase 5 validation T506 must pass before this work starts.
        acceptance
            Every disposition row has runtime absence, declaration negatives, and behavior
            rejection before side effects where that row requires them.
            No alias, adapter, overload, translator, registry, parser branch, or wrapper preserves
            deleted behavior.
            Retained routes remain live through their production owners.
            Run `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:types`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite build`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:packed-consumers`,
            `nubx vp test packages/flow-state-rewrite`, and `nub run lint`. Expected: all checks pass.
