            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.6.4 (open).
            Proof IDs: CUT-P05, CUT-P06, PROOF-017.
            Deliverable: One active owner for each live obligation, followed by removal or
            historical marking of obsolete authority and files kept only for deleted behavior.
            Allowed writes: exact stale paths enumerated by the accepted disposition ledger,
            after Workflow authority transfer. Legacy contract files and Bead records are
            provenance only; mark or remove them only where the accepted disposition lists them.
            Evidence: Accepted Workflow owner mapping and a changed-path record linking every
            removal to transferred evidence.
            Workflow owns active task and semantic authority. Package promotion in Cutover.Q1
            remains unresolved; keep this Task draft and make no package-promotion claim.
            Phase 5 validation T506 must pass before this work starts.
        acceptance
            Every live obligation maps to an accepted Workflow Plan, Task, or proof before removal.
            Legacy contract files and Bead records remain provenance only.
            Only files explicitly classified as historical or deletion-only are removed or marked.
            While Cutover.Q1 is unresolved, do not claim package promotion. Once resolved, run
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:types`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite build`,
            `nubx vp test packages/flow-state-rewrite`, `nub run docs:build`, and
            `nub run lint`. Expected: all checks pass.
