        description
            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.6.5 (open).
            Proof IDs: CLI-P02, CUT-P01 through CUT-P06, PROOF-016, PROOF-017.
            Deliverable: Fresh packed CLI execution, rewrite source and packed parity, browser
            behavior, consumer proofs, deletion audit, and rewrite-package gate receipts.
            Frozen `packages/flow-state` gate results are historical migration evidence only;
            they are not current acceptance gates. Retain any existing source receipts as
            provenance and run current gates against `flow-state-rewrite`.
            Use a newly built and installed package; never rely on checked-in or stale dist.
            Allowed writes: gate scripts and consumer test fixtures only; product fixes return to
            their owning implementation Tasks.
            Evidence: Exact command, package identity, browser, consumer, and gate results in the
            Task handback; no separate evidence ledger.
            Phase 5 validation T506 must pass before this work starts.
        acceptance
            Fresh installed CLI proves rewrite-source and packed behavior parity and cleans
            temporary files. Run `nubx vp test packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/cli/tests`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:types`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite build`, and
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:packed-consumers`,
            `nubx vp test packages/flow-state-rewrite`, and `nub run lint`.
            Application-owned browser checks pass and deleted surfaces fail in consumers.
            No rewrite proof depends on frozen-package gates or stale package output. Resolve
            Cutover.Q1 before claiming product/package promotion.
