        description
            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.6.6 (open); source epic: flow-state-e7p.6 (open).
            Deliverable: Independent, read-only review of Phase 6 implementation and cutover
            evidence against all applicable Workflow Plans and Tasks. Legacy contracts and Bead
            records are provenance only.
            Review every changed diff, owner receipt, deletion and retention implication, and
            unresolved transfer gate. Review the complete Plan crosswalk without repeating
            already accepted behavior matrices.
            Allowed writes: none for reviewers. Return the required handback in the Task result.
            Evidence: Changed paths, focused commands and results, owner coverage, gate status,
            findings, and lint result in the handback.
            Phase 5 validation T506 must pass before this gate runs.
        acceptance
            Return these fields: Workflow Plan references, changed files, focused checks, lint result,
            behavior reviewed, fixed findings, blocking findings, advisory findings.
            Validate Workflow Plan coverage, complete disposition, and production-owner proofs.
            Check PublicSurface.V7 route/deletion, grammar, production behavior, raw/share
            determinism, path validation, non-mutation, and wrong-kind proofs.
            Check Verification.V6 against P4 T400-T404 and P5 T500-T505/T507/T508 receipts for
            persistence, artifacts, server/host behavior, diagnostics, Cause, and CLI gates.
            No blocking finding, unclassified proof gap, hidden compatibility path, or duplicate
            active task owner remains. Legacy contracts and Bead records remain provenance only.
            Do not claim package promotion while Cutover.Q1 is unresolved.
            Repeat the rewrite-targeted gates in T600-T604 and run `nub run lint`.
            Expected: all checks pass and no blocking findings remain.
